                            {
                                "example_id": "f6b2401d-f34d-49b6-8614-f30511972d6a",
                                "sense_id": "7ecc9ecc-a40b-3ca3-996e-2734a8a5cc7c",
                                "text": "Paris had been the birthplace of the Modernist sensibility during the latter half of the previous century, when its cafés, studios and tolerant atmosphere helped nurture the symbolist school in poetry and impressionism in painting. By the start of the First World War, it had sheltered fauvism, cubism, expressionism, vorticism, and a host of other splinter movements through which the emerging culture gradually took shape.",
                                "translation": "上世纪下半叶，巴黎曾是现代主义思潮的发源地，其咖啡馆、工作室和包容的氛围孕育了诗歌中的象征主义流派和绘画中的印象派。到第一次世界大战爆发时，巴黎庇护了野兽派、立体主义、表现主义、漩涡主义以及许多其他分支艺术运动，新兴文化正是借此逐渐成型。"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
